        "Description": "Good evening, 47. \r\rAfter two years, nothing should surprise me anymore. \rWatching you ride a violin like a rocket made me miss when a crowbar or a thrown burger could do the job. Between you and the flying toilets, no wonder some would try to hide under Club Hölle.\r\rBut this one mission... it kept clawing us back. A chapter simply refusing to be closed.\r\rIt is finally time, to go back to our roots.\r\rPack some new undies, 47. Whittleton Creek awaits. \rA new address. The same old nightmares.",
